<node name="JWT" unique_id="276" master_id="0" prog_lang="custom-colors" tags="cwee technology" readonly="0" nosearch_me="0" nosearch_ch="0" custom_icon_id="0" is_bold="0" foreground="" ts_creation="1792540800" ts_lastsave="1792540800">
<rich_text weight="heavy" foreground="#ac8300">At a glance
</rich_text>
<rich_text>What it is: </rich_text>
<rich_text style="italic">e.g. Signed tokens that carry the user's session</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>Where you see it: </rich_text>
<rich_text style="italic">e.g. Authorization header or a cookie</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>Learned in: </rich_text>
<rich_text link="node 43" foreground="#ac8300">M03 - Attacking Authentication Mechanisms</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>Usual tools: </rich_text>
<rich_text style="italic">e.g. </rich_text>
<rich_text style="italic" link="node 275" foreground="#ac8300">Burp Suite</rich_text>
<rich_text style="italic">, jwt_tool</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text scale="h2" weight="heavy" foreground="#ac8300">First Look</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text style="italic" foreground="#8a8d96">the first commands you run against a new instance</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text scale="h2" weight="heavy" foreground="#ac8300">Checklist</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>☐ </rich_text>
<rich_text>Version or framework noted and searched for known issues</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>☐ </rich_text>
<rich_text>Auth and session handling checked</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>☐ </rich_text>
<rich_text>Every input mapped in the app note</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>☐ </rich_text>
<rich_text>Error messages checked for leaks</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>☐ </rich_text>
<rich_text>Access control tried with a second account</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text scale="h2" weight="heavy" foreground="#ac8300">Red Flags</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text style="italic" foreground="#8a8d96">things that usually mean a way forward</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text scale="h2" weight="heavy" foreground="#ac8300">Commands by Goal</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text style="italic" foreground="#8a8d96">one heading per thing you want from it</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text scale="h3" weight="heavy" style="italic">e.g. Check how tokens are verified</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text weight="heavy">Notes</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>• </rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
