<node name="01 - Before You Start" unique_id="278" master_id="0" prog_lang="custom-colors" tags="cwee exam" readonly="0" nosearch_me="0" nosearch_ch="0" custom_icon_id="0" is_bold="0" foreground="" ts_creation="1792540800" ts_lastsave="1792540800">
<rich_text scale="h2" weight="heavy" foreground="#ac8300">Setup</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>☐ </rich_text>
<rich_text>VPN connects and you can reach the first target</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>☐ </rich_text>
<rich_text>Screenshot tool ready (Flameshot or similar). Paste each screenshot straight into the host's node with </rich_text>
<rich_text family="monospace" foreground="#ac8300">Ctrl+V</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>☐ </rich_text>
<rich_text>Screenshot names picked, like </rich_text>
<rich_text family="monospace" foreground="#ac8300">web01-03-shell.png</rich_text>
<rich_text> (item, step, what it shows), so you can find each one when you write the report</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>☐ </rich_text>
<rich_text>Terminal logging on (</rich_text>
<rich_text family="monospace" foreground="#ac8300">tmux</rich_text>
<rich_text> logging or </rich_text>
<rich_text family="monospace" foreground="#ac8300">script</rich_text>
<rich_text>) so you keep every command and its output</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>☐ </rich_text>
<rich_text>Report started from the HTB CWEE template in SysReptor</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>☐ </rich_text>
<rich_text>Autosave and backups on: </rich_text>
<rich_text weight="heavy">File › Preferences › Miscellaneous</rich_text>
<rich_text>, tick </rich_text>
<rich_text weight="heavy">Autosave Every x Minutes</rich_text>
<rich_text> and </rich_text>
<rich_text weight="heavy">Create a Backup Copy Before Saving</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>☐ </rich_text>
<rich_text>A copy of this file kept somewhere private. Only open it in one CherryTree window at a time, or you can lose changes</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text scale="h2" weight="heavy" foreground="#ac8300">Read</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>☐ </rich_text>
<rich_text>Letter of engagement read twice, scope copied into </rich_text>
<rich_text link="node 279" foreground="#ac8300">02 - Scope &amp; Rules</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>☐ </rich_text>
<rich_text>Exam start time, end time and report deadline written down</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>☐ </rich_text>
<rich_text>What counts as a flag and how to submit it</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text scale="h2" weight="heavy" foreground="#ac8300">Plan</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>☐ </rich_text>
<rich_text>Rough plan for each day, with real breaks</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>☐ </rich_text>
<rich_text>Sleep plan. Long exams are lost to fatigue more often than to missing skills.</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>☐ </rich_text>
<rich_text style="italic">e.g. Wordlists and tools ready on your attack box</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text foreground="#8a8d96">────────────────────────────────────────
</rich_text>
<rich_text link="node 277" foreground="#ac8300">Exam</rich_text>
<rich_text> · </rich_text>
<rich_text link="node 1" foreground="#ac8300">Home</rich_text>
<rich_text>
