<node name="03 - Findings" unique_id="280" master_id="0" prog_lang="custom-colors" tags="cwee exam" readonly="0" nosearch_me="0" nosearch_ch="0" custom_icon_id="0" is_bold="0" foreground="" ts_creation="1792540800" ts_lastsave="1792540800">
<rich_text>Write every finding here as you go, then write each one up properly in the report. A finding can be on the attack path or standalone.</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text scale="h2" weight="heavy" foreground="#ac8300">Each finding needs</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>In the report, every finding has: CVSS 4.0, Description &amp; Cause, Security Impact, Affected Component(s), External References, Detailed Walkthrough and Patching and Remediation.</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text scale="h2" weight="heavy" foreground="#ac8300">Severity</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text foreground="#8a8d96">────────────────────────────────────────
</rich_text>
