<rich_text scale="h2" weight="heavy" foreground="#ac8300">Goals Today</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>☐ </rich_text>
<rich_text style="italic">e.g. Get a foothold on the first host</rich_text>
